IAP v1.0 — licensing decision pending

No repository-wide open-source license has been selected for this research
release. This file does not grant a new license to any component. The original
rights and licenses of contributed code, graph data, checkpoints, and upstream
materials remain with their respective rights holders.

Before a public software release, the project maintainer must select terms for
the original IAP code and confirm compatibility with all redistributed assets.
Do not infer that the retained upstream Eon or Dendritron license applies to
the entire IAP repository, or that a future IAP license relicenses their data.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, upstream/, and docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md.
